      "text": "Combine sour cream, cilantro, mayonnaise, jalapeños, and ranch dressing mix in a blender; blend until cilantro and peppers are finely minced and incorporated. You might need to stir it a few times with a spatula to make sure everything's well mixed. Serve immediately or refrigerate.",
